{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0103_1000_p", "source_sha256": "1e89abc95469a8a164f2420b38473e5db5f91f05d0c5d00635e8b4dff7256344", "ja": "（エレナがクリスマスプレゼントを用意したいと\n言うので、買い物に付き合う事になったのだが……）", "zh": "（艾琳娜说想要准备圣诞礼物，\n于是我陪她一起出来购物……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0103_1001_018ele", "source_sha256": "cc18ba14459a090553ad7b2c121dc680cfcc7a7ded435b9a5d1971e40b173c30", "ja": "コトハへのプレゼントは、これでオッケーだネ！\nメグミは……あっ、あっちのお店がいいナ♪", "zh": "这样送琴叶的礼物就OK了！\n惠美的……啊，那家店应该不错♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0103_1002_p", "source_sha256": "48466e8ddcab668aa85d0f93a07c184cbba297fa3336f214281013f3fddce689", "ja": "ま、待ってくれ、エレナ……。\n少し休憩しないか？", "zh": "等、等一下，艾琳娜……\n要不要先休息一下？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0103_1003_018ele", "source_sha256": "cd37f18257892ed1c65622136c237b30b6fec3159f229f86fe5d07ea07748f25", "ja": "あっ！　ごめんネ、{$P$}。\n荷物、重たかった？", "zh": "啊！抱歉，{$P$}。\n袋子是不是很重？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0103_1004_p", "source_sha256": "be867289f1e59040a42c396575f9395a69883548d11129ce7e5023abbfede918", "ja": "いや、重くはないけど……\n買い物のペースが速くて、目が回りそうかな。", "zh": "不会，重是不重……\n只是你买得好快，我逛到头昏眼花了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0103_1005_018ele", "source_sha256": "50bb9f99db471119d186299503fbc62265b982705fbda315a69b767fc489cd6a", "ja": "そうなんだ～。コトハも、たまに\n{$P$}と同じこと言うヨ。", "zh": "原来是这样～琴叶有时候也会说\n跟{$P$}一样的话喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0103_1006_018ele", "source_sha256": "6c923fecb738f01f018db4c8ce078ee068e5f493c1f3eea081e10b89359db952", "ja": "「目が回りそうだから、休憩にしましょう」って。\nワタシとメグミは、大丈夫なんだけどナ～。", "zh": "她会说「逛到快头昏眼花了，先休息一下吧」，\n我和惠美倒是都没感觉说～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0103_1007_018ele", "source_sha256": "11fe48b8032a657b830eb76b7ae3ad44215e205a1a2898b085917343d1f3cde2", "ja": "でも、ずっと歩きっぱなしだったもんネ。\nいいよ、休憩しよっ♪", "zh": "不过，我们的确从刚才就一直在走路呢。\n好，那就休息一下吧♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0103_1008_p", "source_sha256": "db92929eb10ba7d083c85e7a4bf52efe750078046014f6f2676ef5f0ac23a3e1", "ja": "エレナ、本当に元気だな……。\nエレナだってたくさん荷物を持ってるのに。", "zh": "艾琳娜真的很有活力呢……\n你自己手上明明也提了大包小包的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0103_1009_018ele", "source_sha256": "d24a6de057d259ce3b9663d2fc12176c53f614d21d65dd3e1d73e8ec59155446", "ja": "これくらい、へっちゃらだヨー。\n{$P$}も、手伝ってくれるしネ♪", "zh": "这点量不算什么啦～\n{$P$}也帮我拿了很多啊♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0103_1010_p", "source_sha256": "16c1e615968c86e93d85f1fcd2054f32a3c9bec8cd1a9f2efad80e272756d29a", "ja": "もしかして劇場のアイドル達、全員分の\nプレゼントを買うつもりなのか？", "zh": "你该不会想帮剧场的所有偶像\n都买一份礼物吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0103_1011_018ele", "source_sha256": "ac17307bb42436ed1cd56846be04986c4183de6582be4eaf4e0f6ba4abe1030a", "ja": "うん！　でも、アイドルだけじゃないヨ？\nコトリとミサキ、高木シャチョーの分もだヨ♪", "zh": "嗯！不过，不只偶像而已喔！\n还要买小鸟、美咲和高木社长的礼物♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0103_1012_018ele", "source_sha256": "571f518328636ab4f57a2fed87a3e1706e0ac5d16fd858188062847e2c8ec5b3", "ja": "楽しいコトは、みーんなで楽しまないとネ♪", "zh": "开心的事情就是要大家一起享受啊♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0103_1013_p", "source_sha256": "10935302569e6ae55e60564973371fe9d059cfd3cf2afaadf5b45df2ebe39c15", "ja": "それもそうだな。……ところで、青羽さんや音無さん、\n社長の分まであるって事は、もしかして……。", "zh": "说得也是……是说，既然连青羽小姐、\n音无小姐和社长都有份了，莫非……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0103_1014_018ele", "source_sha256": "a02b040d9eb42c2d6a3ee8496846c852307da5ceab2071264b090f543d82514a", "ja": "あ！　{$P$}の分は、\n今日は買わないヨ？", "zh": "啊！\n今天不会买{$P$}的礼物喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0103_1015_018ele", "source_sha256": "6dfd91118a57d1645efa698a45296c49327aa2218cb5a17b36b70d0323af888f", "ja": "だって一緒に買い物しちゃったら、\nサプライズにならないでショ？", "zh": "毕竟要是和你一起买，\n就没办法给你惊喜啦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0103_1016_p", "source_sha256": "aabccef986f35d2e811745d437329783ffb4feb349db83f992b29f44cac1a11a", "ja": "サプライズか……\nエレナは、サプライズにこだわってるんだな。", "zh": "惊喜啊……\n艾琳娜，你很注重这点呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0103_1017_018ele", "source_sha256": "b58c5cae248326ecf53294208a0e0df2ffed7fa1b90dd9582de9b49f6482888d", "ja": "せっかくのクリスマスだし、\nみんなでハッピーに過ごさないとネ♪", "zh": "一年一度的圣诞节，\n当然要大家一起开开心心地度过啰♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0103_1018_018ele", "source_sha256": "3465e73953a378a5b8bde6483f1903aa2a627e9ff745ebfbf4efe52418630845", "ja": "あ！　{$P$}、あのお店で休憩しよ！\nワタシ、クレープが食べたいナ♪", "zh": "啊！{$P$}，\n我们去那家店休息吧！我想吃可丽饼♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0103_1019_p", "source_sha256": "f21b09255303e31caa1f00b4959bbf7f73f0ead4b6b870794773e3e92fae5a1e", "ja": "（エレナの、日常も楽しんでしまう才能はすごいな。\nお返しに、サプライズを用意した方が良さそうだ！）", "zh": "（艾琳娜能够如此享受日常，真是厉害的才能。\n看来我也得为她准备一份惊喜当回礼！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
